  "ruleText": "Soil 301.05 Additional References. All applicants shall provide the names and addresses of additional references if the OPLC determines the original references are unclear, incomplete, or contradictory.\n\nSource. #6232, eff 4-26-96; ss by #6881, eff 11-13-98; ss by #8621, eff 5-2-06; ss #9886-A, eff 3-11-11, EXPIRED: 3-11-19\n\nNew. #14019, eff 9-6-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Soil 300)",
